## Mobile example: cargo-mobile2 output and machine-specific config
# `gen/` is the generated Xcode and Gradle projects. Regenerate with
# `cargo mobile init`; it is build output that bakes in absolute paths and an
# Apple development team id.
crates/viewport-lib-examples/mobile/gen/
# The NDK linker paths are per-machine. `.cargo/config.toml.example` is tracked.
crates/viewport-lib-examples/mobile/.cargo/config.toml
crates/viewport-lib-examples/mobile/local.properties

